{
  "title": "Controllo Telecamere",
  "path": "controllo-telecamere",
  "icon": "mdi:cctv",
  "type": "masonry",
  "cards": [
    {
      "show_state": false,
      "show_name": true,
      "camera_view": "live",
      "fit_mode": "cover",
      "type": "picture-entity",
      "entity": "camera.tracking_scorrevole",
      "name": "Tracking LIVE"
    },
    {
      "type": "grid",
      "columns": 3,
      "square": false,
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "name": "SU",
          "icon": "mdi:arrow-up-bold-circle",
          "tap_action": {
            "action": "perform-action",
            "perform_action": "script.turn_on",
            "target": {
              "entity_id": "script.tracking_ptz_passo"
            },
            "data": {
              "variables": {
                "direzione": "su"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "name": "SINISTRA",
          "icon": "mdi:arrow-left-bold-circle",
          "tap_action": {
            "action": "perform-action",
            "perform_action": "script.turn_on",
            "target": {
              "entity_id": "script.tracking_ptz_passo"
            },
            "data": {
              "variables": {
                "direzione": "sinistra"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "name": "STOP",
          "icon": "mdi:stop-circle",
          "icon_height": "45px",
          "tap_action": {
            "action": "perform-action",
            "perform_action": "button.press",
            "target": {
              "entity_id": "button.tracking_ptz_arresto"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "name": "DESTRA",
          "icon": "mdi:arrow-right-bold-circle",
          "tap_action": {
            "action": "perform-action",
            "perform_action": "script.turn_on",
            "target": {
              "entity_id": "script.tracking_ptz_passo"
            },
            "data": {
              "variables": {
                "direzione": "destra"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": " "
        },
        {
          "type": "button",
          "name": "GIU",
          "icon": "mdi:arrow-down-bold-circle",
          "tap_action": {
            "action": "perform-action",
            "perform_action": "script.turn_on",
            "target": {
              "entity_id": "script.tracking_ptz_passo"
            },
            "data": {
              "variables": {
                "direzione": "giu"
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": " "
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "entities",
      "title": "Posizioni preimpostate PTZ",
      "show_header_toggle": false,
      "entities": [
        {
          "entity": "select.tracking_preimpostazione_ptz",
          "name": "Seleziona posizione"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "entities",
      "title": "Sensibilita Tracking",
      "show_header_toggle": false,
      "entities": [
        {
          "entity": "number.tracking_sensibilita_al_movimento",
          "name": "Movimento"
        },
        {
          "entity": "number.tracking_ai_person_sensitivity",
          "name": "Persone"
        },
        {
          "entity": "number.tracking_ai_vehicle_sensitivity",
          "name": "Veicoli"
        },
        {
          "entity": "number.tracking_ai_animal_sensitivity",
          "name": "Animali"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "# REOLINK TRACKING\nControllo PTZ con arresto automatico.\nUn tocco = un movimento breve.\n"
    },
    {
      "type": "vertical-stack",
      "cards": [
        {
          "type": "markdown",
          "content": "## JOYSTICK PTZ\nUsa le frecce per muovere la telecamera.\nIl tasto centrale arresta il movimento.\n"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
